{"c":[{"name":"20261005T105431Z-2d9978b4db29946e","text":"D2-06: GoalRuns.blocked runs inside Helper.authorize before every act; it must return null once a segment ends, or a goal task's undo (undoBlocked -> authorize) is refused.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T120548Z-9e86109ce30422ae","text":"B30: a goal-planning host's Ask with route plan is offered as a D2-06 goal (planAsk goals:true returns AskGoal; helper.offerGoal); other consumers keep planTask/planWithCode. planAsk overloads: goals absent/false types as AskDraft.","type":"note"}]}
